    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827240/extras/0c4196220e9ea382cd4448d270c5bb5c.avif?t=1753961664\" /></div><br>The thirst for easy gain leads a small mercenary squad and their employer to a lost barony in the forest, plagued by a mysterious illness. It may be a new kind of the Black Death that has spread throughout medieval Europe or the machinations of local witches. A cunning dealer tries to exploit the tragedy for personal gain and traps the mercenaries in a dangerous game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827240/extras/3df654c68626b67107a569a1a39b1110.avif?t=1753961664\" /></div><br><br>The prelude to the Plague Lords game will introduce you to the core mechanics and set the stage for the adventures that await you in Plague Lords. <br><br>Battle the infected, explore lands shrouded in a mysterious epidemic, and try to uncover its secrets!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827240/extras/b58fdafd2ddbc4f5fd90376bdd608e72.poster.avif?t=1753961664\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827240/extras/b58fdafd2ddbc4f5fd90376bdd608e72.webm?t=1753961664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827240/extras/b58fdafd2ddbc4f5fd90376bdd608e72.mp4?t=1753961664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Features </h2></strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827240/extras/b82a588823ad19d0069fc39ebd612317.webp?t=1753961664\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore one of the five main game cities.<br></li><li> Command a small squad of trained soldiers.<br></li><li> Build your own military camp with fortifications and crafting structures.<br></li><li> Utilize skills and constructions for three basic crafts out of the 12 in the main game.<br></li><li> Construct, craft, and apply traps, barricades, and fortifications.<br></li><li> Experience a powerful arsenal with a small squad of experienced and well-armed mercenaries.</li></ul>",
